## Layout

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `{{manifest_filename}}` | generated tool manifest: names, descriptions, JSON Schemas, HTTP bindings |
| `server.py` | entry point, plus the seams for hand-written tools |
| `{{runtime_package}}/` | vendored runtime: manifest loading, env config, auth, HTTP, MCP wiring |
| `.env.example` | every environment variable this server reads |
| `Dockerfile` | container image (stdio today, HTTP transport later) |

Regenerating with `openapi_to_mcp generate --force` rewrites `{{manifest_filename}}`,
`{{runtime_package}}/`, and this README. Keep hand-written tools in `server.py`.
